+   - **Percentage Strategy:**
+     - Set $M[i] = \text{True}$ for all $i \in A$.
+     - Set $M[i] = \text{True}$ for all $i \in N$.
+     - Let $I_{true}$ be the list of indices where $M$ is `True`.
+     - Shuffle $I_{true}$ randomly.
